### AniSphere user-service API 测试脚本（IntelliJ HTTP Client）
### 说明：
### 1) 先启动 user-service（默认端口 9090）
### 2) 执行【登录】请求后，会自动把 token 写入全局变量 {{token}}，后续接口自动携带 Authorization
### 3) 管理员接口 /admin/* 需要登录账号 role=0

@host = http://localhost:9090
@token = {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 1. 注册（可选）
### ----------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test_user_01",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "18800000001",
  "email": "test_user_01@example.com"
}

> {%
  // 注册接口成功时通常也会返回 token（若你的实现返回 data.token）
  if (response.body && response.body.data && response.body.data.token) {
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
  }
%}


### ----------------------------------------
### 2. 登录（必选，后续接口都依赖 token）
### ----------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/user/login?username=test_user_01&password=123456

> {%
  // Result.data.token
  client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
%}


### ----------------------------------------
### 3. 获取我的用户信息（依赖 token）
### ----------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/user/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 4. 修改邮箱（依赖 token）
### ----------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/user/update-email?email=new_email_01@example.com
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 5. 修改手机号（依赖 token）
### ----------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/user/update-phone?newPhone=18800000002
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 6. 修改昵称（依赖 token）
### ----------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/user/update-nickname?newNickname=TestNick01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 7. 修改密码（依赖 token）
### ----------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/user/update-pwd?oldPwd=123456&newPwd=123456
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 8. 根据 uid 查询用户信息（公开接口）
### ----------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/user/find?uid=REPLACE_WITH_USER_UID


### ----------------------------------------
### 9. 登录日志（分页）
### ----------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/user-login-log/page?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 10. 收藏：新增
### ----------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/user-collection/add?targetType=0&targetId=10001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 11. 收藏：是否已收藏
### ----------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/user-collection/is-collected?targetType=0&targetId=10001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 12. 收藏：分页
### ----------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/user-collection/page?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 13. 收藏：取消
### ----------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/user-collection/cancel?targetType=0&targetId=10001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 14. 浏览记录：新增
### ----------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/user-browsing-history/record?targetType=0&targetId=10001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 15. 浏览记录：分页
### ----------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/user-browsing-history/page?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 16. 浏览记录：删除（recordId 需要替换为真实值）
### ----------------------------------------
DELETE {{host}}/user-browsing-history/delete?recordId=REPLACE_WITH_RECORD_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 17. 关注：关注用户（followId 需要替换为真实用户 uid）
### ----------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/user-follow/attention?followId=REPLACE_WITH_FOLLOW_UID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 18. 关注：取消关注
### ----------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/user-follow/cancel-attention?followId=REPLACE_WITH_FOLLOW_UID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 19. 关注：关注列表
### ----------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/user-follow/follow-list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 20. 收货地址：新增
### ----------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/user-address/add
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receiverName": "张三",
  "receiverPhone": "18800000003",
  "province": "广东省",
  "city": "深圳市",
  "district": "南山区",
  "detailAddress": "科技园 1 号",
  "isDefault": "0"
}


### ----------------------------------------
### 21. 收货地址：查询
### ----------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/user-address/find-address
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 22. 收货地址：删除（addressId 需要替换为真实值）
### ----------------------------------------
DELETE {{host}}/user-address/delete-address?addressId=REPLACE_WITH_ADDRESS_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 23. 收货地址：修改（addressId 需要替换为真实值）
### ----------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/user-address/update-address
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addressId": 1,
  "receiverName": "李四",
  "receiverPhone": "18800000004",
  "province": "广东省",
  "city": "深圳市",
  "district": "南山区",
  "detailAddress": "科技园 2 号",
  "isDefault": "0"
}


### ----------------------------------------
### 24. 黑名单：加入
### ----------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/user-blacklist/join-black?blacklistId=REPLACE_WITH_BLOCK_UID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 25. 黑名单：查询当前账号黑名单
### ----------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/user-blacklist/find-blacklist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 26. 黑名单：是否拉黑
### ----------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/user-blacklist/find-isBlackList?blacklistId=REPLACE_WITH_BLOCK_UID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 27. 黑名单：取消拉黑
### ----------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/user-blacklist/cancel-blacklist?blacklistId=REPLACE_WITH_BLOCK_UID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 28. 黑名单：查询所有黑名单（管理员）
### ----------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/user-blacklist/all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 29. 管理员：分页查询用户列表（管理员）
### ----------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/admin/user-all?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
